        {"zh": "我在这儿守候已久。", "en": "I've waited here long."},
        {"zh": "不要逼我出手。", "en": "Don't force my hand."},
        {"zh": "沼泽的泥里，我已经藏好了。", "en": "I'm already hidden in the swamp mud."},
        {"zh": "挪开，泥里才是我的道。", "en": "Move. The mud is my road."},
        {"zh": "别逼我杀死你。", "en": "Don't force me to kill you."},
        {"zh": "退后，否则你死定了。", "en": "Back off, or you're dead."},
        {"zh": "退路是一片深泥。", "en": "Your way back is deep mud."}
      ]
    },
