        {"zh": "沼泽里的泥，拖住你的脚。", "en": "The swamp mud is holding your feet."},
        {"zh": "阳光下，你无处可逃。", "en": "You can't escape the sun."},
        {"zh": "鬼杀队的战士，你输了。", "en": "Sun Warrior, you're defeated."},
